[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11161.83, "timestamp": "03:06:01", "text": "对不起。一点也不缺，伙计。你的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11164.07, "timestamp": "03:06:04", "text": "根据情况而定，目前已经相当不错了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11166.23, "timestamp": "03:06:06", "text": "你说话的方式，你解释的方式"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11168.389, "timestamp": "03:06:08", "text": "东西，你更新信息真快，很快"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11171.03, "timestamp": "03:06:11", "text": "回复方面，一切都很好。甚至"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11173.67, "timestamp": "03:06:13", "text": "比如，我不知道像 YouTube 那样的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11176.87, "timestamp": "03:06:16", "text": "东西。我一直在做 YouTube，因为……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11178.469, "timestamp": "03:06:18", "text": "2015年。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11181.349, "timestamp": "03:06:21", "text": "哇。那就是我，我曾经是，是的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11184.469, "timestamp": "03:06:24", "text": "目前为止大概有七个频道。不，不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11187.03, "timestamp": "03:06:27", "text": "七个，就像五六个频道一样。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11189.349, "timestamp": "03:06:29", "text": "我想我删掉了大部分，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11191.75, "timestamp": "03:06:31", "text": "我测试过一些东西，比如这些东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11193.83, "timestamp": "03:06:33", "text": "这东西管用，这东西不管用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11195.59, "timestamp": "03:06:35", "text": "这就是我做这些事的原因，所以你才知道我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11197.91, "timestamp": "03:06:37", "text": "缩略图有效，我知道如何点击"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11200.71, "timestamp": "03:06:40", "text": "马上就能听到乔尼的声音"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11203.67, "timestamp": "03:06:43", "text": "在你的屏幕上，哦，我等不及了，什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11207.11, "timestamp": "03:06:47", "text": "你们听不到他说话，等等，应该怎么办？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11211.03, "timestamp": "03:06:51", "text": "我做了那个，等等，呃，应用程序捕获"}]